  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN and Timor-Leste Hybrid Food and Agribusiness Short Term Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is a professional development programme (short course), which improves agricultural productivity and income in the ASEAN and Timor-Leste agricultural sector.
The online course will equip scholars with the concepts, principles, and tools they need to leverage value chain approaches to enhance agri-food systems.
The in-country component will&#xA0;continue this learning and&#xA0;solidify their&#xA0;affinity built with Aotearoa New Zealand.</narrative>
  </description>
